      "control_id": "CTL.CODEBUILD.SECRETS.001",
      "control_name": "CodeBuild Projects Must Not Store Secrets in Plaintext Environment Variables",
      "control_description": "CodeBuild project environment variables of type PLAINTEXT must not contain secrets (API keys, tokens, passwords). Plaintext env vars are visible in the AWS console, CLI output, and CloudTrail logs. Use SECRETS_MANAGER or PARAMETER_STORE environment variable types instead.\n",
