        "description": "CodeBuild project contains plaintext secrets in environment variables.",
        "action": "Change environment variable types from PLAINTEXT to SECRETS_MANAGER or PARAMETER_STORE. Store secrets in AWS Secrets Manager or SSM Parameter Store and reference them by name in the environment variable configuration.",
        "example": "{\n  \"compute\": {\n    \"kind\": \"codebuild_project\",\n    \"secrets\": { \"has_plaintext_credentials\": false }\n  }\n}\n"
